Many of the United States' largest firms by market cap are technology
companies. These companies are dominated by the [ Big Five tech giants
](/wiki/Big_Tech "Big Tech") (Apple, Amazon, Google, Microsoft, and Meta),
though numerous software firms also dominate the American technology industry.
These firms range from hardware manufacturers like [ Dell Technologies
](/wiki/Dell_Technologies "Dell Technologies") , [ IBM ](/wiki/IBM "IBM") , [
Hewlett-Packard ](/wiki/Hewlett-Packard "Hewlett-Packard") , and [ Cisco
](/wiki/Cisco "Cisco") , to software and computing infrastructure programmers
like [ Oracle ](/wiki/Oracle_Corporation "Oracle Corporation") , [ Salesforce
](/wiki/Salesforce "Salesforce") , [ Adobe ](/wiki/Adobe_Inc. "Adobe Inc.") ,
and [ Intuit ](/wiki/Intuit "Intuit") .  [447]  [448]

